 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Guarantees",
  "excerpt": "A formally verified smart contract compiler for Ethereum, written in [Lean 4](https://lean-lang.org/). Write a contract in an embedded DSL (or import it from Solidity), prove properties about it, and compile it to EVM bytecode through a compiler whose layers are themselves proved. Documentation: [veritylang.com](https://veritylang.com) · Paper: [verity.pdf](https://lfglabs.dev/papers/verity.pdf) · MIT licensed."
 },
